
Host *
  AddKeysToAgent yes
  IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_rsa
  ##
  ## `WarnWeakCrypto` {yes|no|no-pq-kex}
  ##
  ## Controls whether the user is warned when the cryptographic algorithms
  ## negotiated for the connection are weak or otherwise recommended against.
  ## Warnings may be disabled by turning off a specific warning or by disabling
  ## all warnings. Warnings about connections that don't use a post-quantum key
  ## exchange may be disabled using the `no-pq-kex` flag. `no` will disable all
  ## warnings. The default, equivalent to `yes`, is to enable all warnings.
  ##
  WarnWeakCrypto no

# vim: set filetype=sshconfig:
